  "description": "From remote mountain passes to endless gravel rollers, smooth dirt to rutted backroads, this new all-rounder helps you conquer it all with speed and comfort. The Advanced-grade composite frame combines lightweight efficiency with smooth compliance—so you can hammer out long rides with more comfort and less fatigue. A full composite fork helps soak up bumps, while the D-Fuse seatpost and Contact SLR D-Fuse handlebar dampen shocks and vibrations before they reach your body. The frame is integrated for disc brakes and has added clearance for high-volume tires, up to 45c, giving you smooth confidence on rugged terrain. This model also features the new 12-speed SRAM Force eTap AXS groupset, delivering cutting-edge drivetrain technology with a broad range of gears, wireless electronic shifting performance, and the SRAM AXS app that allows you to view battery status and personalize controls.",
